            "releaseNotes": {
                "releaseNotesTooltip": "<div><span class=\"tooltip-title\">What's new in DeepStream 8.0:</span><ul><li>Support for Blackwell GPUs and Jetson Thor with TAO 6.0 models</li><li>Inference Builder: open\u2011source tool for building inference microservices across AI frameworks</li><li>Pyservicemaker upgrades: prepare/activate APIs, configurable component selection, new sample apps</li><li>Enhanced Tracking: MaskTracker (SAM2\u2011based multi\u2011object tracker) and Multi\u2011View 3D Tracking (MV3DT) with single/multi\u2011view 3D pose estimation</li><li>Enhanced Support: nvvideoconvert for U16 formats, REST API for nvdsanalytics and nvtracker, Dynamic stream handling in demuxer, MediaExtractor on Jetson, nv3dsink on x86, and high\u2011quality pixel formats in nvvideotestsrc, nvdsudpsrc/nvdsudpsink for audio frame sizing & RTP timestamp</li><li>Additional Open\u2011sourced libraries and plugins</li></ul><a href=\"https://docs.nvidia.com/metropolis/deepstream/dev-guide/text/DS_Release_notes.html#whats-new\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"tooltip-link\">Open Release Notes</a></div>",
                "releaseNotesURL": "https://docs.nvidia.com/metropolis/deepstream/dev-guide/text/DS_Release_notes.html#whats-new",
                "releaseNotesDownload": false
            },
